  "$comment": "Only same immutable original C05 vs independently verified V003 C05-derived fork; semantic guard checks complete input map/row time and event pointers/provenance before HTML publication. Never use V002.view.v1 for cross-family original/derived worlds. No fabricated interpolation; two source authorities are explicitly unequal."
}
